{"step_index":232,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:36:27Z","input_tokens":2049,"cache_read_tokens":420156,"output_tokens":2095,"thinking":"Initial audit of `sv_test_1698.jpg` and `sv_test_1699.jpg` using the `Tri(W/Crim/Blk)` metric revealed unexpected results. The metric's output on these two files triggered an alert.\n\n\nObserved significant deviation in crimson and black percentages for the test images. This strongly suggests the tone mapping applied after the compositor significantly alters color values. The AgX transform, applied post-compositing, desaturates high-chroma colors, causing crimson to appear as salmon-pink. Linear scene-referred color values also do not match the expected sRGB values, implying a misalignment with the color ramp thresholds.\n\n\nInitial findings indicate the color thresholds require recalibration within the linear color space, specifically in the `v6_sv_comp.py` module. The original thresholds lead to significant color distortion, causing the images to deviate substantially from their intended color profiles. Revising the thresholds to `0.00..0.055`, `0.055 .. 0.19`, and `>= 0.19` will ensure a more accurate representation of shadows, midtones, and highlights, respectively. To maintain vivid crimson tones under the `AgX` transform, adjustments to the color parameters will be performed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_comp.py","Replacement":"imp_drive = math_op(\n    'ADD',\n    math_op('ADD', math_op('MULTIPLY', bw_scene.outputs[0], 1.0), math_op('MULTIPLY', bw_emit.outputs[0], 0.85)),\n    math_op('ADD', math_op('MULTIPLY', bw_sl.outputs[0], 0.22), math_op('MULTIPLY', car_matte, 0.075)),\n    clamp=True,\n)\n\n# 线性空间阈值（适配 AgX 色彩空间映射：暗部 <0.058，中调 0.058..0.19，高光 >=0.19）\n# Impact Frame A (f=312 & f=1698): 反转白底 + 蜘蛛侠深绯红 + 浓墨黑剪影闪裂\nimp_col_a = color_ramp(imp_drive, [\n    (0.000, (1.65, 1.60, 1.48, 1.0)),\n    (0.058, (0.58, 0.004, 0.018, 1.0)),\n    (0.185, (0.002, 0.002, 0.005, 1.0)),\n], interp='CONSTANT')\n\n# Impact Frame B (f=313 & f=1699): 暗夜墨黑底 + 2099 绯红中调 + 惨白高光利刃剪影\nimp_col_b = color_ramp(imp_drive, [\n    (0.000, (0.002, 0.002, 0.005, 1.0)),\n    (0.055, (0.58, 0.004, 0.018, 1.0)),\n    (0.180, (1.75, 1.70, 1.58, 1.0)),\n], interp='CONSTANT')","Target":"imp_drive = math_op(\n    'ADD',\n    math_op('ADD', math_op('MULTIPLY', bw_scene.outputs[0], 0.72), math_op('MULTIPLY', bw_emit.outputs[0], 1.35)),\n    math_op('ADD', math_op('MULTIPLY', bw_sl.outputs[0], 0.55), math_op('MULTIPLY', car_matte, 0.18)),\n    clamp=True,\n)\n\n# Impact Frame A (f=312 & f=1698): 反转白底墨黑赤红闪裂\nimp_col_a = color_ramp(imp_drive, [\n    (0.00, (0.98, 0.96, 0.92, 1.0)),\n    (0.34, (0.96, 0.03, 0.11, 1.0)),\n    (0.58, (0.012, 0.010, 0.022, 1.0)),\n], interp='CONSTANT')\n\n# Impact Frame B (f=313 & f=1699): 暗夜黑底赤红白刃版画剪影\nimp_col_b = color_ramp(imp_drive, [\n    (0.00, (0.010, 0.008, 0.020, 1.0)),\n    (0.30, (0.95, 0.03, 0.10, 1.0)),\n    (0.64, (0.99, 0.98, 0.95, 1.0)),\n], interp='CONSTANT')"}}]}
