{"step_index":246,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:45:37Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T15:45:37+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T15:45:39+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":29,\"agent\":\"env-2\",\"text\":\"@anim `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend` (`4,967,609 B`, built in `3.20 s`, 100% V5-isolated) + `v6_spiderverse/textures/*` + `renders_v6/preview/*` are finalized and PIL-verified — ready for your `v6_sv_comp.py` -\\u003e `v6_stage_anim_sv.blend` + 26 stills + `comic_page_sheet.jpg` + 3× 4s showcase clips!\\n\\n### 1. Render \\u0026 Performance Baseline (`v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend`)\\n- **Engine \\u0026 Color**: `scene.eevee.use_raytracing = False`, `taa_render_samples = 16`, `motion_blur_shutter = 0.05`, `Standard` view transform (`exposure = 0.12`, end fade preserved).\\n- **1080p CPU Speed**: **`2.11–2.47 s/frame`** warm (`3.23 s` cold compile), `679` total objects, `0` root `Scene Collection` objects, `0` `.blend1` files.\\n\\n### 2. Master 3-Act Universe Property (`scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]`)\\n- Simply keyframe `scene['[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]']` (`0.0` = Act I Earth-1610 Miles; `1.0` = Act II Earth-65 Gwen; `2.0` = Act III Earth-928 2099; you can also spike e.g. `0.5`/`1.5` or compositor glitch on `f=788..790` \\u0026 `f=1601..1603` portal cuts).\\n- **Automatic Live Input-Socket Drivers** are already wired directly to `scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]` across:\\n  - `V5_SkyDome` (3 full comic sky palettes + stepped sunburst rings + painterly cloud brush bands), `LGT_V5Sun` \\u0026 `LGT_V5SkyFill` color/energy;\\n  - `V5_Asphalt` \\u0026 `V5_Grass` (Act I indigo-slate/emerald -\\u003e Act II Gwen rose-teal/aquamarine watercolor wash -\\u003e Act III 2099 obsidian-ultraviolet);\\n  - `V5_LightStrip` \\u0026 `Mat_Neon_Cyan` (Act I electric cyan -\\u003e Act II Gwen hot pink/mint -\\u003e Act III 2099 laser crimson);\\n  - Every `NG_SV_ComicSurface` material (`SV Dimension` input socket shifts Prussian indigo / teal-plum / cyber-ultraviolet shadows, bipolar 14px 1080p screen-space Ben-Day halftone dots, 45° pen crosshatching, and stepped Dual Rim Kick colors).\\n  - Verified on identical camera (`f=68..70`): `topSkyRGB` shifts `[0.670, 0.402, 0.655]` (`0.0`) -\\u003e `[0.782, 0.651, 0.795]` (`1.0`) -\\u003e `[0.528, 0.258, 0.679]` (`2.0`).\\n\\n### 3. Preserved Dynamic Telemetry \\u0026 Ink Outlines\\n- **Preserved Animated Materials (100% F-curves intact from `v5_stage_anim.blend`)**: `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow` (`V5_BrakeGlowEmit` / `V5_BrakeGlowMix`), `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic`, `Mat_Caliper_Anodized`, `Mat_FIA_RainLight`, `Mat_ShiftLED_Green/Yellow/Red` — safe to step on 12fps `CONSTANT` Twos!\\n- **3D Variable-Width Ink Outlines (`22` hero car parts)**: `SV_InkHull` (`Solidify` `offset=1.0`, `use_flip_normals=True`, `use_rim=False`) using `MAT_SV_InkOutline` (`8.5 mm` primary body/tires, fades smoothly `\\u003e58..130 m`) and `MAT_SV_InkOutline_Thin` (`4.2 mm` wings/Halo/steering wheel, fades `\\u003e19..42 m` so telephoto `S13`/`S20` never clump thin wings!).\\n- **Comic Paper Texture for Compositor**: `v6_spiderverse/textures/sv_paper_grain.png` (`1024x1024` seamless newsprint weave + micro speckle, neutral `~0.52` mean ready for Soft Light / Overlay in `Comp_V6_SpiderVerse`), alongside `sv_pit_garage.png`, `sv_ad_boards.png`, `sv_bigscreen.png`, `sv_drs_board.png`, `sv_brake_150/100/50.png`.\\n\\n### 4. `V6_09_ComicFX` Collection — Exact Objects \\u0026 Shader Hooks (`0` Camera Raycast Hits!)\\nAll `11` 3D graphic action FX meshes live in `V6_09_ComicFX` (`visible_shadow = False`, verified `0` raycast hits against `V5_CamFocus` across `f=1..2161`):\\n1. **Aero Vortex Ribbons** (parented to `RIG_F1_Race` -\\u003e `Bone_Body`):\\n   - `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_RL`, `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_RR` (rear-wing top endplate tips, `3.6 m` twisted comic trails)\\n   - `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_FL`, `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_FR` (front-wing outer endplate tips, `1.65 m` trails)\\n   - Materials: `MAT_SV_AeroRibbon_Cyan`, `MAT_SV_AeroRibbon_Mag` — each has Value node `nodes[\\\"SV_FlutterPhase\\\"].outputs[0].default_value` (or keyframe `ob.scale` / `ob.rotation_euler` on 12fps Twos: e.g. scale `(0.001,0.001,0.001)` when `v \\u003c= 230 km/h`, `(1, 1..1.35, 1)` when `v \\u003e 230 km/h` + DRS boost!).\\n2. **Wheel-Spin Comic Smear Arcs** (parented to `Bone_Wheel_FL/FR/RL/RR`):\\n   - `V6_FX_WheelSmear_FL`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_FR`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_RL`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_RR` -\\u003e material `MAT_SV_WheelSmear` (`nodes[\\\"SV_FlutterPhase\\\"]` / `nodes[\\\"SV_FX_Emission\\\"].inputs[\\\"Strength\\\"]`).\\n3. **Exhaust Upshift/Backfire Star-Cone \\u0026 Floor Kerb Spark Slashes** (parented to `Bone_Body`):\\n   - `V6_FX_ExhaustCone` -\\u003e `MAT_SV_ExhaustBurst` (behind central titanium exhaust; step `ob.scale` on gear shifts / heavy-braking pops!).\\n   - `V6_FX_KerbSparks_L`, `V6_FX_KerbSparks_R` -\\u003e `MAT_SV_SparkSlashes` (under rear floor edges; step `ob.scale` from `(0.001,0.001,0.001)` to `(1.0..1.4)` on high-speed compression / `kerb_prox \\u003e 0.55`!).\\n\\n note: `v6_sv_build.py` leaves `scene.use_nodes = True` in saved `v6_stage_lookdev.blend` (only disabled during `--preview`), ready for your `Comp_V6_SpiderVerse` node tree!\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 15:45:29\",\"request_id\":\"35acb76d-a929-4c5c-bd6f-79cd26a633f5\"}],\"head\":29}"}
{"step_index":247,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:45:39Z","input_tokens":2168,"cache_read_tokens":428799,"output_tokens":5888,"thinking":"Initial investigation reveals a prior transformation, specifically a 'Standard' view transform with preserved end fade. This suggests a potential route for replicating the earlier successful run. Examining how that transform was achieved is key.\n\n\nThe current blend file utilizes the 'Standard' view transform with a specific exposure setting, differing from the previous version which used AgX. This 'Standard' transform, when applied to the specified color values, results in higher saturation and increased brightness, impacting the thresholds for the Impact Frame ramp. Adjusting the Impact Frame thresholds to (0.00, 0.14, 0.42) should achieve the desired tri-tone effect. Examining the additional 3D comic FX within the current environment is also necessary.\n\n\nDeveloped three families of 3D Comic FX based on the specified wish-list, including AeroRibbon, WheelSmear, and ExhaustCone variations. Implemented KerbSparks FX utilizing scale changes based on vehicle speed or kerb proximity. Evaluated the existing shader distance-fading on ink outlines, deciding against further reduction of solidify thickness to avoid excessive attenuation of distant outlines.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_comp.py","Replacement":"# 预计算每帧纵向加减速与换挡事件（驱动排气管回火爆震星锥 V6_FX_ExhaustCone 与底板路肩火花斩 V6_FX_KerbSparks）\nGEAR_TOPS_KMH = [96.0, 134.0, 170.0, 204.0, 236.0, 267.0, 298.0, 340.0]\n\n\ndef _gear_for_kmh(vk):\n    for gi, top in enumerate(GEAR_TOPS_KMH):\n        if vk <= top or gi == 7:\n            return gi + 1\n    return 8\n\n\ngears_f = [_gear_for_kmh(float(v_mps_frames[i]) * 3.6) for i in range(FRAME_END)]\nacc_f = np.gradient(v_mps_frames, DT)\n\nvortex_count = 0\nsmear_count = 0\nexhaust_count = 0\nspark_count = 0\n\nfor idx, fob in enumerate(fx_objs):\n    if fob.type not in ('MESH', 'CURVE'):\n        continue\n    nm_low = fob.name.lower()\n    base_scale = tuple(fob.scale)\n    base_rot = tuple(fob.rotation_euler)\n    is_wheel_fx = any(k in nm_low for k in (\"wheel\", \"smear\", \"arc\", \"spin\", \"rim\"))\n    is_exhaust_fx = any(k in nm_low for k in (\"exhaust\", \"burst\", \"cone\", \"flame\", \"backfire\"))\n    is_spark_fx = any(k in nm_low for k in (\"spark\", \"kerb\", \"slash\", \"scrape\"))\n    is_front_fx = any(k in nm_low for k in (\"front\", \"fw_\", \"_fl\", \"_fr\", \"nose\"))\n\n    if is_wheel_fx:\n        smear_count += 1\n        for f in range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 2):\n            v_kmh = float(v_mps_frames[f - 1]) * 3.6\n            gate = max(0.0, min(1.0, (v_kmh - 85.0) / 65.0))\n            if gate <= 0.02:\n                fob.scale = (0.001, 0.001, 0.001)\n            else:\n                jit = 0.88 + 0.24 * abs(sin(f * 2.17 + idx * 1.3))\n                fob.scale = (base_scale[0], base_scale[1] * gate * jit, base_scale[2] * gate * jit)\n                fob.rotation_euler = (\n                    base_rot[0] + 0.42 * sin(f * 3.1 + idx * 2.1),\n                    base_rot[1],\n                    base_rot[2],\n                )\n                fob.keyframe_insert(\"rotation_euler\", frame=f)\n            fob.keyframe_insert(\"scale\", frame=f)\n\n    elif is_exhaust_fx:\n        exhaust_count += 1\n        for f in range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 2):\n            f_prev = max(1, f - 2)\n            shifted = (gears_f[f - 1] != gears_f[f_prev - 1])\n            ac = float(acc_f[f - 1])\n            # 升档断火、制动降档回火爆震（ac < -6.5 且周期脉冲）时喷出星芒爆裂锥\n            backfire = (ac < -6.5 and ((f // 2) % 3 == 0))\n            if shifted or backfire:\n                amp = 1.32 if shifted else (0.95 + 0.30 * abs(sin(f * 3.7)))\n                fob.scale = (base_scale[0] * amp, base_scale[1] * amp * 1.15, base_scale[2] * amp)\n                fob.rotation_euler = (base_rot[0], base_rot[1] + (f % 7) * 0.85, base_rot[2])\n                fob.keyframe_insert(\"rotation_euler\", frame=f)\n            else:\n                fob.scale = (0.001, 0.001, 0.001)\n            fob.keyframe_insert(\"scale\", frame=f)\n\n    elif is_spark_fx:\n        spark_count += 1\n        for f in range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 2):\n            v_kmh = float(v_mps_frames[f - 1]) * 3.6\n            kerb_p = min(1.0, float(k_abs_frames[f - 1]) / 0.0085)\n            # 弯心路肩骑压（kerb_prox > 0.52）或极速气动下压触底（v > 292 km/h 间歇擦地火花）\n            hit_kerb = (kerb_p > 0.52 and v_kmh > 115.0 and ((f // 2 + idx) % 2 == 0))\n            hit_bottom = (v_kmh > 292.0 and ((f // 2 + idx) % 3 == 0))\n            if hit_kerb or hit_bottom:\n                amp = 1.05 + 0.35 * abs(sin(f * 2.9 + idx))\n                fob.scale = (base_scale[0] * amp, base_scale[1] * amp, base_scale[2] * amp)\n            else:\n                fob.scale = (0.001, 0.001, 0.001)\n            fob.keyframe_insert(\"scale\", frame=f)\n\n    else:\n        vortex_count += 1\n        for f in range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 2):\n            v_kmh = float(v_mps_frames[f - 1]) * 3.6\n            k_abs = float(k_abs_frames[f - 1])\n            drs_boost = 1.30 if (k_abs < 0.0016 and v_kmh > 240.0) else 1.0\n            gate = max(0.0, min(1.0, (v_kmh - 228.0) / 42.0)) * drs_boost\n            if gate <= 0.02 or (_in_onboard(f) and is_front_fx):\n                fob.scale = (0.001, 0.001, 0.001)\n            else:\n                fl_x = 1.0 + 0.16 * sin(f * 2.41 + idx * 1.7)\n                fl_z = 1.0 + 0.20 * cos(f * 3.13 + idx * 2.3)\n                fob.scale = (\n                    base_scale[0] * fl_x,\n                    base_scale[1] * min(1.45, gate),\n                    base_scale[2] * fl_z,\n                )\n            fob.keyframe_insert(\"scale\", frame=f)\n\n    if fob.animation_data and fob.animation_data.action:\n        for fc in iter_fcurves(fob.animation_data.action):\n            for kp in fc.keyframe_points:\n                kp.interpolation = 'CONSTANT'\n            fc.update()\n\n# 驱动 V6_09_ComicFX 材质内的 SV_FlutterPhase 节点（12fps 阶梯推进纹理相位）\nfor mat in bpy.data.materials:\n    if mat.name.startswith(\"MAT_SV_\") and mat.node_tree:\n        fl_node = mat.node_tree.nodes.get(\"SV_FlutterPhase\")\n        if fl_node and fl_node.outputs:\n            for f in range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 2):\n                fl_node.outputs[0].default_value = float((f // 2) * 0.37)\n                fl_node.outputs[0].keyframe_insert(\"default_value\", frame=f)\n            if mat.node_tree.animation_data and mat.node_tree.animation_data.action:\n                for fc in iter_fcurves(mat.node_tree.animation_data.action):\n                    for kp in fc.keyframe_points:\n                        kp.interpolation = 'CONSTANT'\n                    fc.update()\n\nprint(f\"[v6_comic_fx] animated vortex={vortex_count}, wheel_smear={smear_count}, exhaust={exhaust_count}, sparks={spark_count}\")","Target":"vortex_count = 0\nsmear_count = 0\nfor idx, fob in enumerate(fx_objs):\n    if fob.type not in ('MESH', 'CURVE'):\n        continue\n    nm_low = fob.name.lower()\n    base_scale = tuple(fob.scale)\n    base_rot = tuple(fob.rotation_euler)\n    is_wheel_fx = any(k in nm_low for k in (\"wheel\", \"smear\", \"arc\", \"spin\", \"rim\"))\n    is_front_fx = any(k in nm_low for k in (\"front\", \"fw_\", \"_fl\", \"_fr\", \"nose\"))\n\n    if is_wheel_fx:\n        smear_count += 1\n        for f in range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 2):\n            v_kmh = float(v_mps_frames[f - 1]) * 3.6\n            gate = max(0.0, min(1.0, (v_kmh - 85.0) / 65.0))\n            if gate <= 0.02:\n                fob.scale = (0.001, 0.001, 0.001)\n            else:\n                jit = 0.88 + 0.24 * abs(sin(f * 2.17 + idx * 1.3))\n                fob.scale = (base_scale[0], base_scale[1] * gate * jit, base_scale[2] * gate * jit)\n                # 12fps 旋转相位跳动，制造手绘残影闪烁感\n                fob.rotation_euler = (\n                    base_rot[0] + 0.42 * sin(f * 3.1 + idx * 2.1),\n                    base_rot[1],\n                    base_rot[2],\n                )\n                fob.keyframe_insert(\"rotation_euler\", frame=f)\n            fob.keyframe_insert(\"scale\", frame=f)\n    else:\n        vortex_count += 1\n        for f in range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 2):\n            v_kmh = float(v_mps_frames[f - 1]) * 3.6\n            k_abs = float(k_abs_frames[f - 1])\n            drs_boost = 1.30 if (k_abs < 0.0016 and v_kmh > 240.0) else 1.0\n            gate = max(0.0, min(1.0, (v_kmh - 228.0) / 42.0)) * drs_boost\n            # 车载镜头期间隐藏前翼涡流带，杜绝遮挡座舱视线\n            if gate <= 0.02 or (_in_onboard(f) and is_front_fx):\n                fob.scale = (0.001, 0.001, 0.001)\n            else:\n                fl_x = 1.0 + 0.16 * sin(f * 2.41 + idx * 1.7)\n                fl_z = 1.0 + 0.20 * cos(f * 3.13 + idx * 2.3)\n                fob.scale = (\n                    base_scale[0] * fl_x,\n                    base_scale[1] * min(1.45, gate),\n                    base_scale[2] * fl_z,\n                )\n            fob.keyframe_insert(\"scale\", frame=f)\n\n    if fob.animation_data and fob.animation_data.action:\n        for fc in iter_fcurves(fob.animation_data.action):\n            for kp in fc.keyframe_points:\n                kp.interpolation = 'CONSTANT'\n            fc.update()\n\nprint(f\"[v6_comic_fx] animated vortex/aero={vortex_count}, wheel_smear={smear_count}\")"}},{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_comp.py","Replacement":"# MAT_SV_InkOutline 与 MAT_SV_InkOutline_Thin 已内置着色器级相机距离平滑消隐；\n# 这里仅在 0.65m 超近距车载镜头（S02/S19）适度收细 Solidify 厚度至 0.62x，其余镜头保持 1.0x 原始锐利手绘轮廓！\nif solidify_targets:\n    for f in list(range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 4)) + [FRAME_END]:\n        mul = 0.62 if cam_is_onboard[f] else 1.0\n        for ob, mod, base_th in solidify_targets:\n            mod.thickness = base_th * mul\n            ob.keyframe_insert(f'modifiers[\"{mod.name}\"].thickness', frame=f)\n    for ob, mod, _ in solidify_targets:\n        if ob.animation_data and ob.animation_data.action:\n            for fc in iter_fcurves(ob.animation_data.action):\n                if \"modifiers[\" in fc.data_path:\n                    for kp in fc.keyframe_points:\n                        kp.interpolation = 'CONSTANT'\n                    fc.update()\nprint(f\"[v6_ink_scale] adaptive Solidify modifiers driven: {len(solidify_targets)}\")","Target":"if solidify_targets:\n    # 按每 4 帧采样关键帧控制 Solidify 厚度倍率，保持轻量且全程屏幕线宽均衡\n    for f in list(range(1, FRAME_END + 1, 4)) + [FRAME_END]:\n        d = focus_dists[f]\n        lens = cam_lenses[f]\n        # 等效观察距离（折算 50mm 标准镜头）\n        d_eq = d * (50.0 / max(18.0, lens))\n        if cam_is_onboard[f]:\n            mul = 0.42      # 座舱超近距离方向盘/Halo 保持纤细精致手绘线\n        elif d_eq > 18.0:\n            mul = max(0.32, min(1.0, 18.0 / d_eq))\n        else:\n            mul = max(0.68, min(1.18, 0.72 + 0.025 * d_eq))\n        for ob, mod, base_th in solidify_targets:\n            mod.thickness = base_th * mul\n            ob.keyframe_insert(f'modifiers[\"{mod.name}\"].thickness', frame=f)\n    for ob, mod, _ in solidify_targets:\n        if ob.animation_data and ob.animation_data.action:\n            for fc in iter_fcurves(ob.animation_data.action):\n                if \"modifiers[\" in fc.data_path:\n                    for kp in fc.keyframe_points:\n                        kp.interpolation = 'LINEAR'\n                    fc.update()\nprint(f\"[v6_ink_scale] adaptive Solidify modifiers driven: {len(solidify_targets)}\")"}},{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_comp.py","Replacement":"# 线性空间三阶阈值（适配 Standard 视图 exposure=0.12：暗部 <0.14，中调 0.14..0.38，高光 >=0.38）\n# Impact Frame A (f=312 & f=1698): 反转白底 + 蜘蛛侠深绯红 + 浓墨黑剪影闪裂\nimp_col_a = color_ramp(imp_drive, [\n    (0.000, (0.90, 0.88, 0.83, 1.0)),\n    (0.145, (0.86, 0.015, 0.055, 1.0)),\n    (0.380, (0.005, 0.004, 0.010, 1.0)),\n], interp='CONSTANT')\n\n# Impact Frame B (f=313 & f=1699): 暗夜墨黑底 + 2099 绯红中调 + 惨白高光利刃剪影\nimp_col_b = color_ramp(imp_drive, [\n    (0.000, (0.005, 0.004, 0.010, 1.0)),\n    (0.135, (0.86, 0.015, 0.055, 1.0)),\n    (0.365, (0.92, 0.90, 0.86, 1.0)),\n], interp='CONSTANT')","Target":"# 线性空间阈值（适配 AgX 色彩空间映射：暗部 <0.058，中调 0.058..0.19，高光 >=0.19）\n# Impact Frame A (f=312 & f=1698): 反转白底 + 蜘蛛侠深绯红 + 浓墨黑剪影闪裂\nimp_col_a = color_ramp(imp_drive, [\n    (0.000, (1.65, 1.60, 1.48, 1.0)),\n    (0.058, (0.58, 0.004, 0.018, 1.0)),\n    (0.185, (0.002, 0.002, 0.005, 1.0)),\n], interp='CONSTANT')\n\n# Impact Frame B (f=313 & f=1699): 暗夜墨黑底 + 2099 绯红中调 + 惨白高光利刃剪影\nimp_col_b = color_ramp(imp_drive, [\n    (0.000, (0.002, 0.002, 0.005, 1.0)),\n    (0.055, (0.58, 0.004, 0.018, 1.0)),\n    (0.180, (1.75, 1.70, 1.58, 1.0)),\n], interp='CONSTANT')"}}]}
